  "description": "FormWind for Krypton Toolkit applications: classes on Krypton controls map to their state palettes (KryptonApplier), and a Krypton palette built from the FormWind theme makes the whole Krypton UI follow the chosen preset and dark mode (TwKryptonTheme). Krypton Toolkit 100.25 and later.",
